# ─── Internal working docs (playbooks, runbooks, scratch) ───────
# These are private operational notes and strategy memos. Keep
# everything we write for ourselves rather than for the dataset
# audience under one of these patterns. The convention is:
# - docs/      : private operational/strategy memos
# - *PLAYBOOK* : strategy playbooks (any directory)
# - *RUNBOOK*  : ops runbooks (any directory)
# - deploy_*   : local deploy helpers tied to this machine
# - diagnose_*, test_*  : ad-hoc debug scripts
# Anything we want to publish goes outside these patterns.
docs/
*PLAYBOOK*.md
*RUNBOOK*.md
deploy_*.sh
diagnose_*.py
test_live_*.py
test_parser_*.py
reset_2026_*.sql
browser_extract_*.js
scripts/capture_*.py

# Scratchpad from agent sessions
outputs/
